{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026szuR9ecns31795077166.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>APEC領導人非正式會議，各領導人就宣言達成共識，行政長官李家超指，相關成果具前瞻性。</p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超說：「各成員經濟體就領導人宣言達成共識，同時通過有關貿易數字化、數字經濟、新興科技、互聯互通等領導人層級等成果文件，這些具前瞻性成果，對推進亞太地區務實合作、深化區域經濟融合、推動高質量發展發揮關鍵作用。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:35:02.749376+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T15:53:04.463352+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:28:25.404734+00:00","content_hash":"6c546cfc16806cb1e6fd0d12c73f399efc8e4b52327656683569b8ff8d4daf0c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:35:02.749376+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}